Possible spoiler ahead

Like I said, possible spoiler ahead

While I was deep in the underworld, I had just gotten the candelobra(sp) when
I got cursed by a lich.  I took a look at what got cursed and found that
the Bell of Opening was the victim.  So I #applyed the bell.  Up pops 3 wraiths
a few vampire types and a few Zombies.  After putting on my ring of conflict,
I took care of the vistors.  I found out that if I ring a cursed bell, the
nasties undeads would pop up and to add to the fun, since I was in Valid's
tower, they could not dig or teleport.  Also, the intelligent nasties would
read or zap a few extra monsters in.  I find that wielding a cockatrice and
make lots of statues (including one of Mr. Yenagu(sp)).

In half an hour, I went from level 19 to level 30 and from 220 HPs to 500+HP
there was lots of healing potions, and wands of speed monster and invisiblility
with a few create monsters too.

I'm glad I finally found out that the Master Liches cursing you are good for
something after all.  (but I still hate them...)

